{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/layout\/sizethatfits(proposal:subviews:cache:)"]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sizeThatFits"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"proposal"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI16ProposedViewSizeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ProposedViewSize"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subviews"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP8Subviewsa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Subviews"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"cache"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP5CacheQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Cache"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4SizeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Size"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP12sizeThatFits8proposal8subviews5cacheAA4SizeVAA012ProposedViewK0V_AA0D8SubviewsV5CacheQzztF","title":"sizeThatFits(proposal:subviews:cache:)","required":true},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sizeThatFits","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"proposal","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize","text":"ProposedViewSize","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI16ProposedViewSizeV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"subviews","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Subviews","text":"Subviews","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP8Subviewsa"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/Cache","text":"Cache","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI6LayoutP5CacheQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Size","text":"Size","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4SizeV"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A size proposal for the container. The container’s parent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view that calls this method might call the method more than once"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with different proposals to learn more about the container’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flexibility before deciding which proposal to use for placement."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"proposal"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A collection of proxies that represent the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"views that the container arranges. You can use the proxies in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collection to get information about the subviews as you determine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"how much space the container needs to display them.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"subviews"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Optional storage for calculated data that you can share among","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the methods of your custom layout container. See","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"makeCache(subviews:)-23agy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for details.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"cache"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A size that indicates how much space the container","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needs to arrange its subviews.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Implement this method to tell your custom layout container’s parent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view how much space the container needs for a set of subviews, given","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a size proposal. The parent might call this method more than once","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"during a layout pass with different proposed sizes to test the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flexibility of the container, using proposals like:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize\/zero","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" proposal; respond with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layout’s minimum size."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize\/infinity"},{"type":"text","text":" proposal; respond with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layout’s maximum size."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize\/unspecified","isActive":true},{"text":" proposal; respond with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layout’s ideal size.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The parent might also choose to test flexibility in one dimension at a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time. For example, a horizontal stack might propose a fixed height and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an infinite width, and then the same height with a zero width."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example calculates the size for a basic vertical stack"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that places views in a column, with no spacing between the views:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["private struct BasicVStack: Layout {","    func sizeThatFits(","        proposal: ProposedViewSize,","        subviews: Subviews,","        cache: inout ()","    ) -> CGSize {","        subviews.reduce(CGSize.zero) { result, subview in","            let size = subview.sizeThatFits(.unspecified)","            return CGSize(","                width: max(result.width, size.width),","                height: result.height + size.height)","        }","    }","","    \/\/ This layout also needs a placeSubviews() implementation.","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The implementation asks each subview for its ideal size by calling the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LayoutSubview\/sizeThatFits(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method with an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ProposedViewSize\/unspecified","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" proposed size."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It then reduces these values into a single size that represents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the maximum subview width and the sum of subview heights."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because this example isn’t flexible, it ignores its size proposal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"input and always returns the same value for a given set of subviews."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI views choose their own size, so the layout engine always"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"uses a value that you return from this method as the actual size of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"composite view. That size factors into the construction of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"bounds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"input to the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/placeSubviews(in:proposal:subviews:cache:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the size of the composite view, given a proposed size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the view’s subviews."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Layout\/sizeThatFits(proposal:subviews:cache:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ProposedViewSize/zero":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A size proposal that contains zero in both dimensions.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/pro